  1397	def test_npm_docs_carry_no_bare_version_literal(tmp_path):
  1398	    """P1-2. `npm/INTEGRITY.md` declared its own version and drifted three
  1399	    minors behind `VERSION` while `bump --stable` correctly reported a no-op:
  1400	    the file is not a bump site and — until this commit — not a scanned
  1401	    surface either. The cure is version-NEUTRAL prose, not a new writer row
  1402	    (a writer with no oracle is the dead rule `_release_bump_sites.py`
