  2342	def _live_tool_versions() -> Dict[str, str]:
  2343	    """codex pins read from the LIVE governance files, not from memory.
  2344	
  2345	    Both pins drift by ceremony (the semver range has been widened four times);
  2346	    deriving them keeps this control testing the decision instead of decaying
  2347	    into a pin-drift alarm.
