   215	    # F-OPS2 — fork-PR gate (defense-in-depth; schedule always runs on
   480	# is the exact false-positive class these filters exist to prevent: a single S237
   481	# A3 hook-parity probe pinned BOTH skill_unknown_ratio and cache_discipline_alerted
   482	# to red on an otherwise-idle window. A CLOSED SET of the three registered probe
   483	# archetypes — not a `_probe_` PREFIX match — keeps this advisory detector from
